        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-11T08:35:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, but IIUC, with the current code, it will. UpstreamMonitor doesn\u0027t stop to think about whether the downstream in P2P and just notifies of upstream changes. When startTethering() is called with TETHERING_WIFI_P2P, it will trigger the entitlement check if cellular happens to be the default network, even if it\u0027s not going to be used.\n\nAm I missing something ?",
      "parentUuid": "7afc3694_d36cced4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 481,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 481,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "79ceeec47da94c24ea19e07ca54922f2e1f8e6de",
